    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="47">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 47</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ealle we sculon ænne God wurðian 7 lufian 7 ænne Cristendom georne healdan 7 ælcne hæþendom mid ealle awurpan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">We must all love and honour one God and zealously hold one Christian faith and entirely cast out every heathen practice.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">We must all revere and love one God and fervently adhere to one Christian faith and wholly reject every heathen practice.</ab>
      </div>
